around 50-60 questions in about 100 minutes. I&nbsp;have kept the tests in =
the same format. By taking the tests several times, you will also get used =
to the time management needed to complete the test within the allotted time=
 frame.<br></p></li><li><p><strong>Identify areas of improvements</strong>:=
&nbsp;You can take these tests as many times as you want. These is absolute=
ly no limit on the number of retakes here (You only get 1 attempt in the of=
